  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PNG Improved Technical and Vocational Education and Training for Employment Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Improved TVET for Employment (ITVET4E) Project is to strengthen the capacity of select TVET colleges in PNG to provide programs that are relevant and responsive to labour market needs in priority sectors (agriculture and construction). ITVET4E is jointly funded by ADB, Australia and PNG. Australia&apos;s grant is earmarked for select initiatives, including teacher training and curriculum development.</narrative>
  </description>
